    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1294-a1">

                <pb facs="1015" n="939" xml:id="pg939"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Governor Goethals to Chargé Spencer.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Balboa Heights</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 13, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to our correspondence
                    regarding disarming the Panama police force of the high-power rifles used by
                    them on certain occasions, I beg to state that I noticed a couple of Panaman
                    policemen yesterday patrolling in the vicinity of the fire opposite the Panama
                    Railroad station with rifles.</p>
                <p>Respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. W. Goethals</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
